{"id":"n84292-2-7","stage":2,"title":"하나하나 · 挨个","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n84292-2-7-1","ko":"초대장은 하나하나 손으로 써서 보낼 생각입니다.","zh":"我打算一张一张亲手写邀请函再寄出去。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"초대장은","meaning":"邀请函","explanation":"초대장：邀请函；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"초대장","audio":"/audio/a9a589172180b16ef930.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80507","senseId":"1","lemma":"초대장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"초대장은","audio":"/audio/685266595199547b4e0b.mp3"}},{"text":"하나하나","meaning":"挨个，逐个","explanation":"하나하나：挨个，逐个。","readings":[{"term":"하나하나","audio":"/audio/98c219818719698aec86.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84292","senseId":"2","lemma":"하나하나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하나하나","audio":"/audio/98c219818719698aec86.mp3"}},{"text":"손으로","meaning":"手","explanation":"손：手；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"손","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17608","senseId":"1","lemma":"손","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"손으로","audio":"/audio/76c1e0d34bb2dfa1de41.mp3"}},{"text":"써서","meaning":"写","explanation":"쓰다：写；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65172","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"써서","audio":"/audio/3314fd01207eddd42fec.mp3"}},{"text":"보낼","meaning":"送，寄","explanation":"보내다：送，寄；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"보내다","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66375","senseId":"1","lemma":"보내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보낼","audio":"/audio/5237e8ce24cf888c4462.mp3"}},{"text":"생각입니다.","meaning":"想，决定","explanation":"생각：想，决定；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"4","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각입니다","audio":"/audio/6373f0afc8fff2759430.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a9a589172180b16e","term":"초대장","zh":"邀请函","audio":"/audio/a9a589172180b16ef930.mp3","entryId":"80507","definition":"为了邀请客人参加某项活动、聚会等而发的信函。","pronunciation":["초대짱"]},{"id":"98c219818719698a","term":"하나하나","zh":"挨个，逐个","audio":"/audio/98c219818719698aec86.mp3","entryId":"84292","definition":"各个人。","pronunciation":["하나하나"]},{"id":"27d4fa6af704520d","term":"손","zh":"手","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3","entryId":"17608","definition":"位于手腕的末端，用于摸某物或抓某物时使用的肢体中一部分。","pronunciation":["손"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"写","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"65172","definition":"用铅笔或其它笔等书写工具在纸张等上划线而书写一定的字。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"8af300ffd85ed5a1","term":"보내다","zh":"送，寄","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3","entryId":"66375","definition":"把人或东西等弄到别的地方去。","pronunciation":["보내다"]},{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"想，决定","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","definition":"在心里决意要做某事；或指想做某事的那种决心。","pronunciation":["생각"]}],"audio":"/audio/6c6bc1542e94df366c4a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n84292-2-7-2","ko":"정말 정성이 많이 들어가겠네요.","zh":"那肯定要花很多心思呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"정성이","meaning":"精诚，诚心","explanation":"정성：精诚，诚心；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"정성","audio":"/audio/476a1997460efa83af06.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31756","senseId":"1","lemma":"정성","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정성이","audio":"/audio/27f46c064a25b1da21e6.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많